# The packed members of the local tsd-jsdoc compatibility package: the upstream
# tsd-jsdoc@2.5.0 compiled payload plus its upstream README, all retained byte
# for byte. Those bytes are the tarball's identity (pack-compat.mjs packs twice
# and requires identical archives), so reformatting one would break
# reproducibility and the provenance claim. pack-compat.mjs itself is not packed
# and stays formatted.
Tools/tsd-jsdoc-compat/dist/
Tools/tsd-jsdoc-compat/README.md
# Byte-pinned golden fixtures. Every file here is compared byte-for-byte or
# hashed by Tools/wave-end-contact-sheet-index.spec.mjs, so any formatter run
# — including the prettier --write the pre-commit hook applies to staged
# .md/.html/.mjs — invalidates the goldens. golden-summary.md in particular
# has to stay exactly what Tools/wave-end-gate-receipt.mjs writes (unpadded
# markdown tables), which prettier will never agree with, so making the
# fixtures formatter-stable is not available as an alternative.
